---
alwaysApply: true
---

Before implementing any feature, determine whether an established, well-maintained library already solves the problem.

Prefer mature libraries over custom implementations.

Examples:

- shadcn/ui for UI
- React Hook Form for forms
- Zod for validation
- TanStack Table for tables
- Recharts for charts
- Framer Motion for animations
- date-fns for dates
- Prisma for database access

Only build custom implementations when no suitable library exists or when customization is essential.
